    "updated_at": "2024-01-15T08:28:06Z",
    "body": "You're right @domenic, type already should be insured. However there's other places where `null` values are explicitely set URLPatternInit entries.\r\n\r\nDuring initialization [process a URLPatternInit](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#process-a-urlpatterninit) is called with all url parts argument to `null` ! The function allow null to be passed for these arguments but they are only use to fill an URLPatternInit struct.",
