    "created_at": "2024-01-26T17:06:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-26T17:06:33Z",
    "body": "I don't follow the argument for a non-empty string guard. Of course this is going to fail ultimately, but it seems fine for it to do so in \"process a URLPatternInit\" 11.2 (after we fail to parse the empty string as a URL).",
